## Graywind Heights

The map is **shadows** on snow — *here the wind cuts those who speak loud*. You did not return to the street: **same** silence, **different** ceiling — snow pretending range. Echo, wound, or promise: altitude **evens** even the rumor of **Vetrnax**, thread of ancient frost like the first night afraid of the sky.

{{throneOutcomeLine}}

{{factionThroneEcho}}

**White** purse, **axis** to follow — the throne stayed behind. Every breath pays **interest** to the cold.
